### IDBTransaction.prototype.abort()

Source: https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/idbtransaction/index.md

Rolls back all changes to objects in the database associated with the transaction. Fires an error event if the transaction has already been aborted or completed.

```APIDOC
## IDBTransaction.abort()

### Description
Rolls back all the changes to objects in the database associated with this transaction. If this transaction has been aborted or completed, this method fires an error event.

### Syntax
```javascript
transaction.abort();
```
```
